Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Maryland.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}September 17, 1862.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:07.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Along a creek called Antietam, two armies fight from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:08.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}dawn until dark.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.25,0:00:07.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1031 0 l 1031 132 l 0 132{\p0}
