Dialogue: 3,0:01:02.61,0:01:08.36,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}AMBULANCE DRILL, THE NEWLY ORGANIZED CORPS · AFTER ANTIETAM
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.39,0:01:37.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Sabres and bayonets, the weapons of old paintings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:39.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}caused fewer than one in 200.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:34.64,0:01:39.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1031 0 l 1031 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:01:34.64,0:01:39.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:01:34.64,0:01:39.96,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PHOTO · PHOTOGRAPHIC HISTORY OF THE CIVIL WAR, VOL. 2 (1911)
Dialogue: 3,0:01:34.64,0:01:39.96,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}KNAP'S BATTERY · ANTIETAM, 1862
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:27.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}That number hides something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.09,0:02:30.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It only counts men who reached a surgeon alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.23,0:02:33.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Many men hit in the head or body never did.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:25.47,0:02:31.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1031 0 l 1031 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:25.47,0:02:31.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:25.47,0:02:31.22,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PHOTO · PHOTOGRAPHIC HISTORY OF THE CIVIL WAR, VOL. 2 (1911)
Dialogue: 3,0:02:25.47,0:02:31.22,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}THE SHERRICK FARM · ANTIETAM, 1862
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:52.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Arms and legs were different.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.46,0:02:53.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}You could live.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.48,0:02:56.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But a soft lead ball that splintered a thigh bone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.82,0:02:59.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}left a surgeon in 1862 with very few choices.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.73,0:02:56.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1031 0 l 1031 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:50.73,0:02:56.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:50.73,0:02:56.48,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PHOTO · PHOTOGRAPHIC HISTORY OF THE CIVIL WAR, VOL. 2 (1911)
Dialogue: 3,0:02:50.73,0:02:56.48,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}THE RUINED MUMMA FARM · ANTIETAM, 1862
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:02.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Think about what that meant on the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.76,0:03:05.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A man hit in the arm could often walk to the rear on
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.99,0:03:06.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.49,0:03:08.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A man hit in the leg could not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:11.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}He lay where he fell, and waited for someone to come.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:00.59,0:03:06.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1031 0 l 1031 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:00.59,0:03:06.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
