Dialogue: 3,0:03:38.55,0:03:44.30,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}THE POTOMAC CROSSING · AFTER ANTIETAM, 1862
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.68,0:03:54.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At the first battle of Bull Run, in July 1861, the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.19,0:03:57.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Army's ambulances were driven by hired civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.62,0:04:00.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Many of them abandoned their posts.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:50.93,0:03:56.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1124 0 l 1124 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:50.93,0:03:56.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
