Dialogue: 3,0:03:50.93,0:03:56.68,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A HOUSE USED AS A HOSPITAL · FIRST BULL RUN, 1861
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.52,0:04:03.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Army's own history records wounded men left for
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.69,0:04:06.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}long periods unattended on the field, and walking
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:10.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}wounded who made their own way back toward Washington.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:00.77,0:04:06.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1146 0 l 1146 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:04:00.77,0:04:06.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:04:00.77,0:04:06.52,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PHOTO · PHOTOGRAPHIC HISTORY OF THE CIVIL WAR, VOL. 7 (1911)
Dialogue: 3,0:04:00.77,0:04:06.52,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}STONE CHURCH USED AS A HOSPITAL · CENTREVILLE, VA.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.54,0:04:25.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Worse, officers used them as private carriages.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:28.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Letterman wrote that they were too often used as if
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.19,0:04:31.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}they had been made for the convenience of commanding
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.19,0:04:31.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}officers.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:22.79,0:04:28.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1403 0 l 1403 132 l 0 132{\p0}
