Dialogue: 3,0:04:22.79,0:04:28.54,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TWO-WHEELED AND FOUR-WHEELED AMBULANCES · PLACE NOT IDENTIFIED
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.16,0:04:35.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And many of the early ambulances had just two wheels.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:32.41,0:04:35.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 998 0 l 998 132 l 0 132{\p0}
