Dialogue: 3,0:04:32.41,0:04:35.64,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ENGRAVING · MEDICAL AND SURGICAL HISTORY OF THE WAR (1883)
Dialogue: 3,0:04:32.41,0:04:35.64,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A TWO-WHEELED AMBULANCE · FRONT AND REAR
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:55.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In the spring of 1862, the Union army moved up the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.09,0:04:57.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Virginia Peninsula toward Richmond.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.43,0:05:00.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Its medical director, Charles Tripler, called many
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.77,0:05:03.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}of the two-wheelers good for nothing.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:52.00,0:04:57.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1338 0 l 1338 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:04:52.00,0:04:57.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
