Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.24,0:28:19.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Roughly 4,000 of the most serious cases passed through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.69,0:28:22.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On one August day, nearly half its patients were
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.54,0:28:23.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Confederates.
