Dialogue: 3,0:28:16.49,0:28:22.24,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}COOK HOUSE, GENERAL HOSPITAL · GETTYSBURG
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.27,0:28:32.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}When the tents finally came down in November, a
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.14,0:28:35.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}nurse named Sophronia Bucklin looked at the bare,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.13,0:28:38.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}trampled ground where the wards had stood, and wrote
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.30,0:28:41.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}that each space marked where the dead had lain.
