Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.61,0:28:45.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Camp Letterman closed on November 20, 1863.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.12,0:28:48.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The day before, nearby, President Lincoln had
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.78,0:28:51.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}dedicated the new national cemetery.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:41.86,0:28:47.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1188 0 l 1188 132 l 0 132{\p0}
