Dialogue: 3,0:28:52.41,0:28:54.10,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}GETTYSBURG BATTLEFIELD TODAY
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.47,0:29:10.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Washington became a city of the wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.06,0:29:13.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Walt Whitman wrote that within sight of the Capitol
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.35,0:29:16.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}stood some thirty or forty such hospitals, at times
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.64,0:29:18.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}holding 50,000 to 70,000 men.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:07.72,0:29:13.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1031 0 l 1031 132 l 0 132{\p0}
