Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.96,0:29:21.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The new ones were built as pavilions:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.26,0:29:24.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}long, narrow wards, with windows in facing pairs, so
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.48,0:29:26.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}air could blow straight through.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.46,0:29:29.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It was a lesson taken from Florence Nightingale and
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.62,0:29:30.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the Crimean War.
