Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.06,0:29:35.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Satterlee Hospital, in West Philadelphia, opened in
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.35,0:29:38.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}June 1862, with more than 3,500 beds.
