Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.91,0:29:42.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Mower Hospital, in Chestnut Hill, had about 3,600.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.50,0:29:46.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Inside, the newer hospitals did something that seems
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.23,0:29:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}obvious now:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.09,0:29:49.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}they divided their wards by disease.
