Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.12,0:29:51.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Inside, the wards were long and bright.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:50.37,0:29:52.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1031 0 l 1031 132 l 0 132{\p0}
