Dialogue: 3,0:29:50.37,0:29:52.40,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A WARD · ARMORY SQUARE HOSPITAL, WASHINGTON
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.45,0:29:54.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Getting there was its own journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.60,0:29:58.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}More than 25,000 men were carried north by hospital train.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:52.70,0:29:58.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 953 0 l 953 132 l 0 132{\p0}
