Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.73,0:30:02.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In one wartime sketch of a hospital car, wounded men
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.08,0:30:05.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}lie in bunks stacked in tiers along both walls, with
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.44,0:30:07.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}an attendant bent over one of them.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:58.98,0:30:04.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1167 0 l 1167 132 l 0 132{\p0}
