Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.15,0:30:11.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Hospital ships were refitted deck by deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.65,0:30:13.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The steamship J. K.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.24,0:30:17.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Barnes, fitted out in New York in 1864, held more
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.33,0:30:18.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}than 350 bunks.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:08.40,0:30:14.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1017 0 l 1017 132 l 0 132{\p0}
