Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.03,0:30:23.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On the rivers, hospital steamers did the same. The D. A.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.55,0:30:25.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}January had nearly 450 beds.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.81,0:30:30.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In four years, it carried more than 23,000 wounded men.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:19.28,0:30:25.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 998 0 l 998 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:30:19.28,0:30:25.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:30:19.28,0:30:25.03,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ENGRAVING · MEDICAL AND SURGICAL HISTORY OF THE WAR (1883)
Dialogue: 3,0:30:19.28,0:30:25.03,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}HOSPITAL STEAMER D. A. JANUARY
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.70,0:30:32.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And the Navy had its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.19,0:30:35.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The side-wheel steamer Red Rover, captured from the
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.24,0:30:38.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Confederates, became the Navy's first hospital ship.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:30.95,0:30:36.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1060 0 l 1060 132 l 0 132{\p0}
