Dialogue: 3,0:30:30.95,0:30:36.70,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}HOSPITAL STEAMER RED ROVER · MISSISSIPPI RIVER
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.80,0:30:41.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It carried an operating room, a laundry, an elevator
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.93,0:30:42.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}and bathrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.77,0:30:45.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}More than two thousand patients passed through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.79,0:30:48.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Catholic Sisters of the Holy Cross nursed aboard,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.74,0:30:51.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}among the first women to serve on a Navy ship.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:39.05,0:30:44.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 845 0 l 845 132 l 0 132{\p0}
