Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.95,0:38:49.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And the lesson of Antietam, that the wounded must be
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.04,0:38:51.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}moved fast, by trained people, with a plan made
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.83,0:38:54.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}before the battle, is still drilled again and again,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.92,0:38:56.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}in exercises like these.
