Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.88,0:39:20.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The surgeons could not see germs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.90,0:39:23.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}They could not save most belly wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.23,0:39:26.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But they learned to move you, to sort you, to put
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.23,0:39:29.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}you to sleep, and to write it all down, so the next
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.35,0:39:31.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}war's doctors could do better.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:19.13,0:39:24.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1124 0 l 1124 132 l 0 132{\p0}
