Dialogue: 3,0:39:19.13,0:39:24.88,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}DR. JONATHAN LETTERMAN WITH HIS STAFF · NOV. 1862
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.64,0:39:33.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So walk the road one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.94,0:39:35.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A soft lead ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.21,0:39:38.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A field where, in 1861, you might have lain for a
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.85,0:39:39.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}day or more.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.75,0:39:42.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A man in a green cap band, and a stretcher.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:31.89,0:39:37.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1031 0 l 1031 132 l 0 132{\p0}
