Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.40,0:39:44.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A barn full of hay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.71,0:39:47.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Three surgeons chosen for their skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.34,0:39:49.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A folded cloth cone, and a deep sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.97,0:39:52.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A saw, used fast, because fast was safer.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:43.65,0:39:49.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1081 0 l 1081 132 l 0 132{\p0}
