Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.25,0:39:55.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Then the fever you could not see.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.63,0:39:56.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A hospital train.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.86,0:40:00.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A long, bright ward with windows on both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.24,0:40:03.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A woman with a basin, or a poet with an orange.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.63,0:40:07.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And if you lived, an empty sleeve, and a pension of
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.31,0:40:08.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}$8 a month.
